[00:01.53]Ima, shizuka na yoru no naka de
[00:06.06]Mukeikaku ni
[00:08.57]kuruma wo hashiraseta
[00:13.09]Hidari donari, anata no
[00:16.45]yokogao wo tsuki ga terashita
[00:22.64]Tada, omoide wo saguru you ni
[00:27.28]Tadoru you ni
[00:29.91] kotoba wo tsunagi
[00:32.85]awasereba
[00:35.17]Dou shiyou mo naku
[00:37.50] afurete kuru hibi no kioku
[00:43.58]Anata no soba de ikiru to
[00:47.39]kimeta sono hi kara
[00:50.01]Sukoshi zutsu kawari hajimeta sekai
[00:54.81]Tsuyoku aru you ni yowasa wo kakusu you ni
[01:00.27]Enjite kita hibi ni
[01:04.88]Aru hi totsuzen
[01:07.04]arawareta sono mana zashi ga
[01:11.52]Shiranakatta koto oshiete kureta
[01:16.04]Mamorubeki mono ga
[01:19.12]areba sore dake de
[01:21.59]Konna ni mo tsuyoku narerunda
[01:42.87]Fukai fukai kurayami no naka de
[01:47.82]Deai, tomo ni sugoshite kita
[01:52.21]Rui no nai hibi
[01:54.97]Kokochi yokatta
[01:56.72]Iya, shiawase datta
[01:59.34]Tashika ni hora
[02:00.73]Sukuwaretan da yo
[02:03.67]Anata ni
[02:06.32]Wazuka na hikari wo toraete kagayaita no wa
[02:12.66]Marude nagareboshi no you na namida
[02:17.60]Bukiyou na inochi kara
[02:20.45]nagarete kobore ochita
[02:23.14]Utsukushii namida
[02:30.13]Tsuyoku ooki na karada ni himeta yasashisa mo
[02:36.83]Dokoka kurushige na sono kao mo
[02:41.48]Itoshiku omounda
[02:44.29]Sugata katachi janainda
[02:46.91]Yatto kidzuitanda
[02:51.49]Mujou ni hibiku juusei
[02:55.21]ga yoru wo hikisaku
[02:58.01]Wakare no ibuki ga osoi kakaru
[03:02.86]Setsuna ni kagayaita mujihi na nagareboshi
[03:08.26]Inori wa tada
[03:09.85]todokazu ni kieta
[03:13.64]Kono, te no naka de moetsukita
[03:18.23]Kin'iro no yasashii suisei wo
[03:25.30]Utsukushii tategami wo
[03:28.74]kurayami no naka nigirishimeta
